  m_text: Each cube travels +X<->-X on its own PlayableDirector. PER-TIMELINE clips scale ONLY that director's clock (0.5x / 2x / stat / -1x reverse vs a grey 1x control). WORLD clips push UnityEngine.Time.timeScale GLOBALLY (bullet-time slows even clipless GameTime movers; freeze=0 is SAFE only on UnscaledGameTime; World x Timeline COMPOUND to 0.25x). SPEED-FROM-STAT scales playback from a clamped stat with a 0.05 floor (never freezes). PLAY MODE required.
